OL,3,GNEWSAEvening closures planned for
OL,4,ARichmond Hill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main route to the south of the Isle
OL,7,Fof Man will be closed in the evenings
OL,8,Ffrom Monday to Thursday while
OL,9,Fmaintenance work is carried out.
OL,11,FThe Department of Infrastructure (DOI)
OL,12,Fsaid Richmond Hill would be shut
OL,13,Fbetween 18:30 BST and 22:30.
OL,15,FThe work will involve jetting out
OL,16,Fbeanie kerbs and clearing gullies to
OL,17,Fimprove drainage ahead of winter, it
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
